            "review_title": "Review at Rainbow Yogurt",
            "review_text": "Larry G\nWashington DC, District of Columbia56 contributions\n0\nThis one bucks the trend\nJan 2017 • Family\nSoft-serve yogurt places have been closing faster than they are opening. This new venue offers interesting frozen yogurt flavors like cucumber melon, durian, green tea, along with the usual flavors.\n\nThere is a toppings bar. You pour your choice of yogurts, top them and buy by weight. It is worth the review because most of the frozen yogurt places I have known closed. This one is in District 6. There is a limited food menu.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2017",
